### Bearer auth — httpbin validates any Bearer token ({{token}} from the env)
GET https://httpbin.org/bearer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Basic auth — succeeds only with the matching credentials in the URL path
# httpbin checks the Authorization header against /basic-auth/<user>/<pass>.
# 'ZGVtbzpzZWNyZXQ=' is base64("demo:secret") — matches the env values.
GET https://httpbin.org/basic-auth/demo/secret
Authorization: Basic ZGVtbzpzZWNyZXQ=
Accept: application/json

### Basic auth — wrong credentials → 401 Unauthorized
GET https://httpbin.org/basic-auth/demo/secret
Authorization: Basic d3Jvbmc6bm9wZQ==

### Echo every request header back
GET https://httpbin.org/headers
X-Custom-Header: tide-commander-sample
X-Request-Source: http-building
Accept: application/json

### Response headers inspection — httpbin sets a custom response header
GET https://httpbin.org/response-headers?X-Sample-Header=hello-from-query&Content-Language=en
